{"hw":"θολόω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">θολόω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">θολ-όω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">make turbid</b>, prop. of water, <span class=\"gk\">θ. ἅπαντα</span>, of the cuttle-fish, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antiph.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">26.2</span> </span>; of fishermen, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">311</span> </span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">τεθολωμένα ὕδατα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hp.</span> </span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">Aër.</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τεθ. ἀήρ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Philyll.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> metaph., <span class=\"gk\">θολοῖ δὲ καρδίαν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Alc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1067</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τεθολωμένος</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">confounded</b> by joy, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pherecr.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">115</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">θολοῦσθαί τι τῶν σπλάγχνων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Philostr.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">VA</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.7</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">γένος.. τεθολωμένον γειτόνημα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Procop.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Goth.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.19</sp